                h2.cg-section-title About Ciphergram
                p.cg-section-lead.text-left Ciphergram is a backend systems consultancy founded by engineers who specialize in Go, AWS, and distributed systems design. We focus on infrastructure-level problems that directly affect cost, performance, and scalability—not front-end experiments or generic product builds.
                p We work the way your CTO or platform lead would want: narrow scope, explicit tradeoffs, and recommendations you can implement or hand to your team with confidence.
                h4.cg-subhead Why technical leaders bring us in
                ul.cg-bullet-list
                    li Deep Go backend engineering for services, workers, and high-throughput paths
                    li Hands-on AWS and Lambda experience—not slideware architecture
                    li Systems architecture background spanning event-driven design, reliability, and cost-aware scaling
